flowchart LR
    IMEM["Instruction memory<br/>256 × 16"]
    DMEM["Data memory<br/>256 × 8"]

    subgraph CPU["Tiny CPU core"]
        PC["PC<br/>8-bit word address"]
        DEC["Decode + control"]
        ACC["Accumulator A<br/>8 bits"]
        ALU["ALU<br/>8-bit add"]
        ACC --> ALU
        ALU --> ACC
    end

    PC -->|fetch address| IMEM
    IMEM -->|instruction word| DEC
    DEC -->|operand / ALU control| ALU
    DEC -->|next PC / halt control| PC
    DEC -->|data address / write enable / write byte| DMEM
    DMEM -->|read byte| ALU
